ement states\n+and the 425-update / 17-checkpoint exact-control overlap. Study monitor71909\n+and repeat-verifier41512 are terminal with exit0; no training job remains.\n+All 13,340 returned files were compared directly byte-for-byte with builder\n+originals (zero differences). See `decision.md`, `run-001/verification.json`,\n+`returned-verification-001.json` and `integrity-and-custody.md`.\n+\n The user authorized implementation and execution with â€œjust do it, dont stopâ€.\n@@ -16,3 +25,3 @@\n \n-Status: study launched on the builder at 2026-09-09 14:32 UTC. Check actual\n+Historical launch: the study started on the builder at 2026-09-09 1mperature (degC)
